   {
    "title": "Unannounced Title",
    "description": "The newest game cooking inside the Phyken Media office. While we can't quite say what it is that we're making, we promise that it will be awesome (and involve Wizards)!\n\nFor this project I was mostly tasked with designing and creating all the GUI in the game. I also collaborated with the other designers to create the core gameplay loop and monetization strategy. Finally I helped guide the team throughout the progress of development.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Sep 2013 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "Wizard Ops Tactics",
    "description": "Build and Customize your armies as you challenge your friends in this 3D, turn based, strategy game! The game will initially launch on iOS and Android at the end of April. \n\nFor this game, I managed the project from it's initial concept to it's launch. When I wasn't managing the project I assisted in the placement of Menus and helped design 6 Units and 10 Weapons. Towards the end of the project I also created promotional trailers and images by compositing existing art assets.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jul 2012 - Present"
